+            <title id="plot-title">Depth against mission time</title><desc id="plot-desc">Depth increases downward. White solid trace is true depth, orange crosses are processed depth fixes, mint solid trace is the filter estimate, violet dotted trace is comparison A, gray dashed trace is dead reckoning. The mint band is the filter's marginal 95 percent depth interval. Read the telemetry below for the current values.</desc>
