+          </svg>
+          <figcaption class="legend"><span class="truth">● Truth</span><span class="measurement">× Depth fix</span><span class="filter">━ Estimate B</span><span class="reference">··· Pinned A</span><span class="dead">┄ Dead reckoning</span><span class="confidence">▰ B ±1.96σ depth</span></figcaption>
