+      <div class="intro-copy"><h2>Navigate the uncertain.</h2><p>A robot, noisy depth fixes, and a better guess. Tune a real Kalman filter and watch confidence meet reality.</p><a href="#learn" class="text-link">New to filters? Follow one correction ↗</a></div>
+    </section>
+    <noscript><section class="panel fallback"><h2>This experiment needs JavaScript</h2><p>A Kalman filter predicts depth from velocity and thrust, then corrects that prediction using noisy localization fixes. Its uncertainty grows between fixes. A missing or biased sensor can leave the robot confident but wrong. Enable JavaScript to step through the model and compare tuning. No data leaves your browser.</p></section></noscript>
