+## Abyss / uncertainty observatory
+
+`/kalman/` is a static, dependency-free, RoboSub-inspired depth estimation lab. Run `node kalman/preview.cjs` and open `http://localhost:8313/secret/` or `http://localhost:8313/kalman/`. Play, pause, step, inspect a time, or go to the 60-second endpoint. Actual sensor noise and replay seed create a new mission; changing assumed Q/R refilters the same data. Pin B as A to compare tuning. All controls use native keyboard behavior. See `DELIVERY.md` for verification and limitations.
+
+Run `node --test tests/*.test.cjs` for numerical and site regression tests.
 
