+          <label for="q">Acceleration variance <span>q / m²/s⁴</span></label><div class="value-line"><output id="q-value" for="q" aria-live="off">0.0036</output><span>trust the model less →</span></div><input id="q" type="range" min="0" max="0.06" step="0.0004" value="0.0036"><p class="hint">Q = q GGᵀ, G = [h²/2, h]ᵀ.<br>Actual acceleration σ = 0.06 m/s².</p>
