+    <section class="results panel" aria-labelledby="results-title">
+      <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / PAIRED OBSERVATIONS</p><h2 id="results-title">Same ocean. Two beliefs.</h2></div><span id="result-stage" class="tag">CUMULATIVE · 0 s</span></div>
+      <div class="results-layout"><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption>Depth RMSE up to the inspected time, in meters. Lower means less error.</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Estimator</th><th scope="col">RMSE / m</th><th scope="col">Truth in 95% band</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="b-row"><th scope="row">B / active filter</th><td id="rmse-b">—</td><td id="coverage-b">—</td></tr><tr class="a-row"><th scope="row">A / pinned filter</th><td id="rmse-a">—</td><td id="coverage-a">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Raw depth fixes</th><td id="rmse-raw">—</td><td>—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dead reckoning</th><td id="rmse-dead">—</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table><p class="hint" id="metric-note">Filter and dead reckoning use every 0.25 s step. Raw RMSE uses available fixes only.</p></div>
+      <div class="diagnosis"><p class="eyebrow">FIELD DIAGNOSIS</p><h3 id="diagnosis-title">Ready for descent.</h3><p id="diagnosis-text">Press Play, step one prediction, or go straight to the mission summary.</p><div class="status-line"><span id="fix-status">Initial state</span><span id="fix-count">0 fixes</span></div></div></div>
