+      <div class="lesson-intro"><p class="eyebrow">04 / INSIDE THE FILTER</p><h2 id="learn-title">Predict.<br>Listen.<br><em>Correct.</em></h2><p>The robot has a depth and a vertical velocity. Thrust advances its prediction. A processed depth fix pulls the estimate toward the sensor, weighted by uncertainty.</p><p>Truth is visible to you for scoring. The filter never sees it.</p><label for="question">Before a dropout, predict what will happen to the band.</label><select id="question"><option value="">Choose your prediction…</option><option value="grows">It will grow without new fixes</option><option value="shrinks">It will shrink as time passes</option><option value="same">It will stay the same</option></select><p id="answer" class="answer" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
